flowchart TB
    Browser[浏览器中的 Vue 3 页面]
    Client[Axios 请求层<br/>自动携带 JWT]
    API[FastAPI API 层]
    Auth[JWT 鉴权与角色判断]
    Graph[LangGraph 工作流]
    QA[问答 Agent]
    Assignment[作业评测 Agent]
    Review[代码审查 Agent]
    Defense[答辩 Agent]
    Sandbox[一次性 Docker 沙箱]
    Models[本地分类/Embedding/Reranker]
    LLM[DeepSeek，可选密钥]
    PG[(PostgreSQL)]
    Milvus[(Milvus)]
    MinIO[(MinIO)]

    Browser --> Client --> API --> Auth
    Auth --> Graph
    Graph --> QA
    Graph --> Assignment
    Graph --> Review
    Graph --> Defense
    QA --> Models
    QA --> Milvus
    Milvus --> MinIO
    QA -.生成回答.-> LLM
    Assignment --> Sandbox
    Assignment -.复用本地分析器.-> Review
    Review -.可选语义评审.-> LLM
    Defense -.动态追问与报告.-> LLM
    API --> PG
    Assignment --> PG
    Review --> PG
    Defense --> PG
